{"strongs": "H8098", "word": "שְׁמַעְיָ֫ה(וּׅ", "translit": "she.ma.yah", "root": "שמן", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "priests:", "definition": "שְׁמַעְיָ֫ה(וּׅ proper name, masculine Σαμαιας etc.: שְׁמַעְיָה 1. prophet, Rehoboam's time 1Kgs 12:22 ; 2Chr 12:5 ; 2Chr 12:7 ; 2Chr 12:15 = יָהוּ - 2Chr 11:2 . 2. Jeremiah's time: \\ \\ a. false prophet Jer 29:31 (twice in verse); Jer 29:32 = יָהוּ - v Jer 29:24 . \\ \\ b. יָהוּ - Jer 36:12 . 3. יָהוּ - a prophet's father Jer 26:20 . 4. descendant of Zerubbabel 1Chr 3:22 (twice in verse). 5. in Simeon 1Chr 4:37 . 6. in Reuben 1Chr 5:4 . 7. Levites: \\ \\ a. 1Chr 9:14 . \\ \\ b. v 1Chr 9:16 = שַׁמּוּעַ 3. \\ \\ c. 1Chr 15:8 ; 1Chr 15:11 \\ \\ d. 1Chr 24:6 . \\ \\ e. 1Chr 26:4 ; 1Chr 26:6 ; 1Chr 26:7 feminine 2Chr 29:14 . \\ \\ g. Ezra 8:16 . \\ \\ h. Neh 11:15 . Also יָהוּ - \\ \\ i. 2Chr 17:8 . \\ \\ j. 2Chr 31:15 . \\ \\ k. 2Chr 35:9 . 8. companions of Ezra: \\ \\ a. Ezra: \\ \\ a. Ezra 8:13 . \\ \\ b. Ezra 6:10 . 10 priests: \\ \\ a. Neh 10:9 ; Neh 12:42 . \\ \\ b. v Neh 12:6 .18. \\ \\ c. v Neh 12:35 d. v Neh 12:36 . 11. a prince v Neh 12:34 . אֶשְׁתְּמוֺעַ see above.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8837')\">BDB8837</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8098')\">H8098</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8836')\">BDB8836</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8838')\">BDB8838</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שְׁמַעְיָ֫ה(וּׅ</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <grk>Σαμαιας</grk> etc.: <bdbheb>שְׁמַעְיָה</bdbheb> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> prophet, Rehoboam's time <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:22\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,22)\">1Kgs 12:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 12:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,12,5)\">2Chr 12:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 12:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,12,7)\">2Chr 12:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 12:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,12,15)\">2Chr 12:15</ref> = <bdbheb>יָהוּ</bdbheb>- <ref ref=\"2Chr 11:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,11,2)\">2Chr 11:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> Jeremiah's time: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> false prophet <ref ref=\"Jer 29:31\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,31)\">Jer 29:31</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Jer 29:32\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,32)\">Jer 29:32</ref> = <bdbheb>יָהוּ</bdbheb>- v<ref ref=\"Jer 29:24\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,24)\">Jer 29:24</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>יָהוּ</bdbheb>- <ref ref=\"Jer 36:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,12)\">Jer 36:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>יָהוּ</bdbheb>- a prophet's father <ref ref=\"Jer 26:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,26,20)\">Jer 26:20</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> descendant of Zerubbabel <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:22\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,22)\">1Chr 3:22</ref> (twice in verse). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> in Simeon <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:37\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,37)\">1Chr 4:37</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> in Reuben <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,4)\">1Chr 5:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>7.</b> Levites: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:14\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,14)\">1Chr 9:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> v<ref ref=\"1Chr 9:16\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,16)\">1Chr 9:16</ref> = <bdbheb>שַׁמּוּעַ</bdbheb> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,8)\">1Chr 15:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,11)\">1Chr 15:11</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,6)\">1Chr 24:6</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,4)\">1Chr 26:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,6)\">1Chr 26:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,7)\">1Chr 26:7</ref> <b>feminine</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,14)\">2Chr 29:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:16\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,16)\">Ezra 8:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>h.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 11:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,15)\">Neh 11:15</ref>. Also <bdbheb>יָהוּ</bdbheb>- <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>i.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 17:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,17,8)\">2Chr 17:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>j.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,15)\">2Chr 31:15</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>k.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,9)\">2Chr 35:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>8.</b> companions of Ezra: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> Ezra: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:13\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,13)\">Ezra 8:13</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:10\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,10)\">Ezra 6:10</ref>. <b>10</b> <highlightword>priests:</highlightword> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 10:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,9)\">Neh 10:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:42\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,42)\">Neh 12:42</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> v<ref ref=\"Neh 12:6\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,6)\">Neh 12:6</ref>.18. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> v<ref ref=\"Neh 12:35\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,35)\">Neh 12:35</ref> d. v<ref ref=\"Neh 12:36\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,36)\">Neh 12:36</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>11.</b> a prince v<ref ref=\"Neh 12:34\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,34)\">Neh 12:34</ref>. </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>אֶשְׁתְּמוֺעַ</bdbheb> see above.</p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Kgs 12:22", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 12, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "2Chr 12:5", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "2Chr 12:7", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "2Chr 12:15", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "2Chr 11:2", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Jer 29:31", "book": "JER", "chapter": 29, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Jer 29:32", "book": "JER", "chapter": 29, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "Jer 29:24", "book": "JER", "chapter": 29, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Jer 36:12", "book": "JER", "chapter": 36, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Jer 26:20", "book": "JER", "chapte